# The fundamental quasi-TE mode of a buried strip; the index rises with width towards the slab value.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy. Bounds: cladding index and slab index.
title Silicon strip 550 x 220 nm, quasi-TE
grid dx=0.025 dy=0.02
window width=3.0 ymin=-1.0 ymax=1.22
rect si -0.275 0.275 0 0.22
symmetry even
field te
expect neff 2.551149786 2e-8
expect group_index 4.014257634 2e-6
expect confinement 0.735119908 1e-6
expect area 0.143014821 1e-5
expect guided yes
expect cells 6660
expect neff_between 1.444 2.847782
